{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-15a52396", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that define a region requiring b-tagged jet.", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers define regions that require b-tagged jets:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Signal Region (SR)\n- **2004.04545**: \"Had\" region\n- **2007.02873**: \n  - 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\n  - 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2012.01581**: Final signal region (Region H)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2107.12553**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2111.08340**: $t\\bar{t}$ control region (CR$_{t\\bar{t}}$)\n- **2304.08962**: Signal region (SR): tight vertex, m4mu<11 GeV, ΔR<0.25\n- **2401.05299**: \n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n  - 2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions\n- **2506.13565**: 1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)\n- **2508.13900**: \n  - 0L, 0 S-jet category\n  - 0L, 1 S-jet category\n  - 0L, >=5 S-jet category (inclusive)\n  - 1L, 0 S-jet category\n  - 1L, 1 S-jet category\n  - 2L, 0 S-jet category\n\nThese papers cover a variety of regions that require b-tagged jets for their analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "b-tagged jet", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 43, "error": null, "seconds": 0.17}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 483, "error": null, "seconds": 0.007}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:had", "hepkg:region:CR-ttbar", "hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:0l-0j", "hepkg:region:0l-1j", "hepkg:re