{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-24d1fae5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region Signal region SR^Z_1A (3ℓ selection, t̃1→tχ̃2⁰ with χ̃2⁰→h/Zχ̃1⁰, large mass splitting)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"Signal region SR^Z_1A (3ℓ selection, t̃1→tχ̃2⁰ with χ̃2⁰→h/Zχ̃1⁰, large mass splitting)\":\n\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) and \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{*} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n\nThese papers cover a variety of processes and final states, but they all define the specified signal region. \n\n[Answered from the graph]", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Signal region SR^Z_1A (3ℓ selection, t̃1→tχ̃2⁰ with χ̃2⁰→h/Zχ̃1⁰, large mass splitting)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.36}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 44, "error": null, "seconds": 0.003}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-fiducial", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdep-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdom-sr", "hepkg:region:4l-1sfos-sr", "hepkg:region:SRL", "hepkg:region:S