{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-2ac61841", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define regions requiring jets:\n\n- **2004.01678**: Signal Region (SR)\n- **2007.02873**: \n  - 0-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n  - 1-lepton channel multi-jet control region (MJ-CR)\n  - 2-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- **2106.14246**: 2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)\n- **2107.12553**: 12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)\n- **2202.08676**: 3L ttZ control region\n- **2401.05299**:\n  - 2ℓ SS Signal Region\n  - 2ℓ SS Fiducial Region\n  - 3ℓ ttZ Control Region\n  - 2ℓ tt(e) HF non-prompt electron Control Regions\n  - 2ℓ tt(μ) HF non-prompt muon Control Regions\n- **2503.19420**:\n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets\n  - 3-lepton WZ control region, ≥1 jet\n- **2506.13565**: 1 b-tagged jet Signal Region (bsℓℓ / bbℓℓ)\n- **2508.13900**: 0L, ≥5 S-jet category (inclusive)\n\nThese regions are defined in the respective papers and require the presence of jets in the event selection.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Jet", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "seconds": 0.172}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 500, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:had", "hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:0l-5j", "hepkg:region:sr-1b", "hepkg:region:1lep_cr_mj", "hepkg:region:1lep_sr", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:2lep_sr", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-fiducial", "hepkg:region:2l-ss-sr", "hepkg:region:2l-tt-e-cr", "h