{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-92efa76f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define a region requiring Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define regions that require Missing Transverse Momentum (p_T^miss):\n\n1. **0-lepton channel signal region (SR)** - Requires p_T^miss as a proxy for p_T^V in the 0-lepton channel.\n2. **12 non-overlapping signal regions categorized in N_H, N_jets, p_T^miss (Table 8)** - Requires p_T^miss.\n3. **2ℓSS search regions (SS01–SS20)** - Requires p_T^miss > 60 GeV.\n4. **3-lepton Z-dominated signal region** - Requires p_T^miss > 50 GeV.\n5. **Common baseline selection for three-lepton categories (3ℓA–3ℓF)** - Requires p_T^miss > 50 GeV.\n6. **Detector-level dilepton ttbar signal region (baseline event selection)** - Requires p_T^miss.\n7. **Detector-level extra-jet definition region for N_jet measurement** - Requires p_T^miss.\n8. **Detector-level signal region for W -> e nu selection** - Requires p_T^miss.\n9. **Detector-level signal region for W -> mu nu selection** - Requires p_T^miss.\n10. **Dilepton (DL) channel signal region** - Requires p_T^miss.\n11. **H -> WW fiducial phase space (e-mu channel)** - Requires p_T^miss.\n12. **H -> tau tau fiducial phase space** - Requires p_T^miss.\n13. **HMDY charged-current W→ℓν fiducial region** - Requires p_T^miss.\n14. **Monojet region (H->invisible)** - Requires p_T^miss.\n15. **Multilepton channel signal region** - Requires p_T^miss.\n16. **On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)** - Requires p_T^miss.\n17. **SL channel selection, W->e nu decay (reconstructed)** - Requires p_T^miss.\n18. **SL channel selection, W->mu nu decay (reconstructed)** - Requires p_T^miss.\n19. **SR-2ℓ-5j2b** - Requires p_T^miss > 125 GeV.\n\nThese regions are defined in various analyses and are crucial for identifying and isolating specific physics processes. Each region has specific thresholds and requirements for p_T^miss, which are detailed in the respective papers.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Missing transverse momentum", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "seconds": 0.207}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "region_requires_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 82, "error": null, "seconds": 0.003}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:0lep_sr", "hepkg:region:signal-regions", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-zdom-sr", "hepkg:region:preselection", "hepkg:region:three_lepton_baseline", "hepkg:region:detector_sr_dilepton", "hepkg:region:detector_extra_jets", "hepkg:region:w-enu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:w-munu-detector-sr", "hepkg:region:dl_search_region", "hepkg:region:hww_fiducial", "hepkg:region:htautau_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hmdy_cc_wlnu_fiducial", "hepkg:region:hinv_monojet", "hepkg:region:ml-sr", "hepkg:region:sr-wz", "hepkg:region:sl_electron", "hepkg:region:sl_muon", "hepkg:region:sr-2l-5j2b"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 82, "error": null, "seconds": 0.014}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:etmiss", "hepkg:object:extra_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:hadronic_recoil", "hepkg:object:jet-reco", "hepkg:object:jet_reco", "hepkg:object:met", "hepkg:object:met-reco", "hepkg:object:met_reco", "hepkg:object:met_track", "hepkg:object:missing-transverse-momentum", "hepkg:object:missing_et", "hepkg:object:missing_transverse_momentum", "hepkg:object:neutrino", "hepkg:object:parton_top_quark", "hepkg:object:pt_miss", "hepkg:object:track_met", "hepkg:object:w_boson_candidate", "hepkg:object:w_candidate"]}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:etmiss", "hepkg:object:extra_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:hadronic_recoil", "hepkg:object:jet-reco", "hepkg:object:jet_reco", "hepkg:obje