{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-93ed3110", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that estimate a background using Background fixed to SM MC prediction with assigned normalisation uncertainty.", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers estimate a background using the method \"Background fixed to SM MC prediction with assigned normalisation uncertainty\":\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets background and $W$+jets background.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates Z+jets background (Z→νν) and W+jets background.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates W+jets background and Z+jets background.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates $Wt$ single-top background, $Z/\\gamma^{*}+\\mathrm{jets}$ background, and \"Others\" minor background category ($VVV$, $t\\bar{t}t$, $t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t}$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}WW$, $t\\bar{t}WZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $tZ$).\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets MC sample, estimates SM WZ background (three real prompt leptons), and Z+jets (FNP-lepton) background.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets background (primarily Z→tautau) and non-resonant WW diboson background.\n- **2110.11231**: Estimates VVV triboson background.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates $W{+}\\text{jets}$ background and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$ background.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates W+jets background and Z+jets background.\n- **2307.01094**: Estimates $WZ$ + jets background.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background and Z+jets (or virtual photon) background.\n- **2312.04450**: Estimates $Z$+jets background ($Z+b$, $Z+c$, $Z+l$).\n\nThese papers collectively cover a wide range of backgrounds, including various diboson, single-top, and jets backgrounds.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Background fixed to SM MC prediction with assigned normalisation uncertainty", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 49, "error": null, "seconds": 0.245}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "background_uses_method", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 172, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 4, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:vvv", "hepkg:background:wjets", "hepkg:background:ww", "hepkg:background:wz-jets", "hepkg:background:wz", "hepkg:background:wz-plus-jets", "hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:z-plus-jets", "hepkg:sample:zjets", "hepkg:background:zjets"]}, "rows": 34, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background_method:cr_normalisation_fit", "hepkg:background_method:mc-simulation-estimate", "hepkg:background_method:mc_simulation_theory_norm", "hepkg:background_method:singletop-svmass-tail-normalization", "hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting", "hepkg:method:ancillary_category_fit_bkg_constraint", "hepkg:method:barlow_beeston_lite", "hepkg:method:control_region_normalization_fit", "hepkg:method:control_region_validation", "hepkg:method:cr-constrained-fit-normalization", "hepkg:method:cr-data-driven-normalization", "hepkg:method:cr-normalisation-fit", "hepkg:method:cr-normalization-fit", "hepkg:method:cr-normalization-ttbar", "hepkg:method:cr_fit_normalization", "hepkg:method:cross_section_normalization_variation", "hepkg:method:crw", "hepkg:method:crwz2j-fit", "hepkg:method:data-driven-fit-normalisation", "hepkg:method:data_sideband_fit", "hepkg:method:datadriven-normalization-CR", "hepkg:method:datadriven-normalization-SR", "hepkg:method:direct-mc-prediction", "hepkg:method:direct_mc_predic