{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-a5cbb01d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that estimate a background using Data-driven background normalization constrained by control regions/control samples in data.", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers estimate a background using data-driven background normalization constrained by control regions/control samples in data:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Estimates backgrounds including $Z\\to\\nu\\bar{\\nu}$ + heavy-flavour jets, $t\\bar{t}$, and $W$+jets.\n- **2007.02873**: Estimates the Z+jets background.\n- **2010.14293**: Estimates backgrounds including Z+jets and W+jets.\n- **2012.03799**: Estimates backgrounds including ttbar (semileptonic/dileptonic), W+jets, and Z+jets.\n- **2102.01444**: Estimates the $t\\bar{t}$ and Z+jets backgrounds.\n- **2106.01676**: Uses Z+jets MC sample and estimates backgrounds including SM WZ and ttbar.\n- **2109.13808**: Estimates backgrounds including Drell-Yan Z/gamma*+jets and non-resonant WW diboson.\n- **2110.11231**: Estimates the VVV triboson background.\n- **2202.08676**: Estimates the WZ irreducible background.\n- **2208.12095**: Estimates backgrounds including $W{+}\\text{jets}$ and $Z{+}\\text{jets}$.\n- **2211.08028**: Estimates backgrounds including $t t̄$, W+jets, and Z+jets.\n- **2308.02285**: Estimates the top quark-antiquark (ttbar) background.\n\nThese papers use various data-driven methods to estimate backgrounds, including normalization and shape constraints from control regions in data.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Data-driven background normalization constrained by control regions/control samples in data", "kind": "background_method"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.2}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": 