{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-aeb7985d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that estimate the background Mis-identified lepton background.", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers estimate the background from mis-identified leptons:\n\n1. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n2. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n3. **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n4. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}Z\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n5. **2405.18661**: CMS \\(t\\bar{t}+Z^0\\) (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement.\n6. **2510.07527**: HH \\(\\rightarrow\\) bbWW, WW \\(\\rightarrow\\) lvqq/2l2nu analysis result.\n7. **2510.07527**: HH \\(\\rightarrow\\) multilepton analysis result.\n8. **2510.07527**: HH \\(\\rightarrow\\) bbZZ(4l) analysis result.\n9. **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n10. **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\(b\\) final state.\n11. **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV.\n\nThese papers cover a range of analyses involving various final states and processes, all of which include the estimation of the mis-identified lepton background.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Mis-identified lepton background", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.221}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 124, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbww_lvqq_2l2nu", "hepkg:result:bbzz", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.007}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbww_misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:bbzz_zplusx", "hepkg:background:charge-flip-electrons", "hepkg:background:charge-misid", "hepkg:background:charge_misid", "hepkg:background:cosmic-ray-muons-mumu", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:dps", "hepkg:background:dy_background", "hepkg:background:ew-singlelepton", "hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons", "hepkg:background:fake-nonprompt-leptons", "hepkg:background:fnp", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton-rjr", "hepkg:background:gamma-jets", "hepkg:background:gamma_jet_jetjet_misid", "hepkg:background:heavy-flavor-mumu", "hepkg:background:jet-to-tauh-misid", "hepkg:background:jets-nonprompt", "hepkg:background:mis-id-leptons", "hepkg:background:misid-lepton", "hepkg:background:misid_hadron", "hepkg:background:misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:misid_ltau_had", "hepkg:background:misid_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:background:misid_symmetry_ff", "hepkg:background:misid_symmetry_mc", "hepkg:background:mt_background", "hepkg:background:multiboson", "hepk