{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-b35efc07", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that define the object Electron.", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers define the object Electron:\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2109.13808**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(\\\\rightarrow e\\nu\\mu\\nu)jj$ production in $36.1\\text{\\,}{\\mathrm{fb}}^{-1}$ of $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Three leptons ($3\\ell$)\"\n- **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2503.19420**: \"4-lepton final state (ZH, all bosons leptonic)\"\n- **2504.13081**: \"Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n- **2605.14245**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of topics including Higgs boson properties, top quark interactions, and differential cross section measurements.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Electron", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "seconds": 0.163}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 109, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:final_state:3l", "hepkg:final_state:4l", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:52d0213216b446bc782fa4dc", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad"]}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:charged_lepton", "hepkg:object:dielectron_vertex", "hepkg:object:dilepton-system", "hepkg:object:dilepton_system", "hepkg:object:displaced-electron", "hepkg:object:electron", "hepkg:object:electron-baseline", "hepkg:object:electron-candidate", "hepkg:object:electron-high-purity", "hepkg:object:electron-reco", "hepkg:object:electron-signal", "hepkg:object:electron_baseline", "hepkg:object:electron_control", "hepkg:object:electron_particle", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:electron_signal_detector", "hepkg:object:electron_veto_detector", "hepkg:object:electron_w", "hepkg:object:forward-proton-candidate", "hepkg:object:id-track", "hepkg:object:lepton", "hepkg:object:lepton-gen", "h