{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-d48cddce", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that report the systematic uncertainty Full set of Section 7 systematic uncertainties included as nuisance parameters.", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers report the systematic uncertainty \"Full set of Section 7 systematic uncertainties included as nuisance parameters\":\n\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2110.11231**: Fiducial WZ production cross section measurement (combined flavour categories)\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2401.07090**: Electron channel (PF-PF) single ratio \\( B(B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ e^+ e^-) / B(B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi(e^+ e^-) K^+) \\)\n- **2401.07090**: Electron channel (PF-LP) single ratio \\( B(B^+ \\rightarrow K^+ e^+ e^-) / B(B^+ \\rightarrow J/\\psi(e^+ e^-) K^+) \\)\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2504.13081**: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV\n- **2604.21670**: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons, and the top quark\n\nThese papers include the systematic uncertainty \"Full set of Section 7 systematic uncertainties included as nuisance parameters\" in their analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Full set of Section 7 systematic uncertainties included as nuisance parameters", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.104}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 150, "error": null, "seconds": 0.007}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:electron_single_ratio_pflp", "hepkg:result:electron_single_ratio_pfpf", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:wz-fiducial-xsec"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:syst:integrated_luminosity", "hepkg:syst:other_systematic_group", "hepkg:syst:pdf", "hepkg:syst:pileup_reweighting", "hepkg:syst:signal_acceptance_pdf_scale", "hepkg:syst:theory_group", "hepkg:systematic:background-estimation-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:background-normalisations", "hepkg:systematic:background-normalization", "hepkg:systematic:background-total-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:background_prediction", "hepkg:systematic:cr-statistical", "hepkg:systematic:cr-to-sr-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:cr_data_statistics", "hepkg:systematic:c