{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-e4120b25", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that measured HH production signal strength (mu_HH).", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers have measured the HH production signal strength (μ_HH):\n\n1. **2004.04545**: *\"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"*\n2. **2009.04363**: *\"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"*\n3. **2111.08340**: *\"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"*\n4. **2503.19420**: *\"Compatibility test of observed mu_WH and mu_ZH with each other and with the SM\"*\n5. **2510.07527**: *\"Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"*\n6. **2604.27044**: *\"Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result\"*\n7. **2604.27044**: *\"Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result\"*\n\nThese papers cover various aspects of HH production and provide measurements of the signal strength.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "HH production signal strength", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.247}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 94, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3", "hepkg:result:combined-run3", "hepkg:result:muwh-zh-compatibility", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:116cfef0