{"run_id": "20260802T154318-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-fe95906c", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that define the region Control region CR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection).", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers define the region \"Control region CR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection)\":\n\n1. **2009.14537**: \"Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\"\n2. **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n3. **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\"\n4. **2207.12246**: \"Measurement of the total cross section and $\\rho$ -parameter from elastic scattering in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n5. **2304.08962**: \"Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\"\n6. **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n7. **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n8. **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV\"\n\nThese papers cover various aspects of the control region for ttZ background normalisation in the 3ℓ selection.", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Control region CR^Z_ttZ for ttZ background normalisation (3ℓ selection)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.146}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "seconds": 0.003}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:de78c3f754afbc4965051e45", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339"]}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:3l-fiducial", "hepkg:region:3l-intc-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-matc-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-misid-emu-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-onz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-vv-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-zgamma-cr", "hepkg:region:AR", "hepkg:region:CR-ttbar", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_b", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_light", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zcc", "hepkg:region:accidental_coincidence_normalization", "hepkg:region:background_template_single_sided", "hepkg:region:background_validation_cr", "hepkg:region:combinatorial-control-sample", "hepkg:region:cr-1mu", "hepkg:region:cr-2lep", "hepkg:region:cr-bins", "hepkg:region:cr-conv", "hepkg:region:cr-ff-offwz", "hepkg:region:cr-mgg-sideband", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbar-offwz-antiid", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbarZ", "hepkg:region:cr-ttz", "hepkg:region:cr-wz-offwz", "hepkg:region:cr-wz-onshell", "hepkg:region:cr-z-e", "hepkg:region:cr-zz", "hepkg:region:cr_misid_samesign_ltau_lprime_mctemplate", "hepkg:region:cr_zee", "hepkg:region:cr_zmumu", "hepkg:region:crtt